  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/IMG_5352.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(271 fotos) Les dones han sigut protagonistes dos dies en les festes del barri de Sant Joaquim a Onda, dijous amb l&#39;exhibici&oacute; i embolada de la seua vaca i divendres,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/ZumbaSantJoaquim.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>amb la masterclass de zumba a c&agrave;rrec de Bea Juan.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/SoparSantJoaquim.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>De nit s&#39;ha fet el sopar de persones s&ograve;cies i representants de l&#39;Ajuntament i d&#39;altres barris.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousdivendressantjoaquim17/img_5206.jpg\" alt=\"img_5206\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousdivendressantjoaquim17/img_5208.jpg\" alt=\"img_5208\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousdivendressantjoaquim17/img_5209.jpg\" alt=\"img_5209\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousdivendressantjoaquim17/img_5210.jpg\" alt=\"img_5210\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousdivendressantjoaquim17/img_5211.jpg\" alt=\"img_5211\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousdivendressantjoaquim17/img_5212.jpg\" alt=\"img_5212\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dijousdivendressantjoaquim17